        {
          "text": "Nukw ivyo vyose birangiye, abakuru baraza barambarira, bat’ Abisirayeli n’abaherezi n’ Abalewi ntibitandukanije n’abantu bo mur’ ibi bihugu, ariko bakora ivy’ ubuyobe, ivy’ Abanyakanani n’ivy’ Abaheti n’ivy’ Abaferizi n’ivy’ Abayebusi n’ivy’ Abamoni n’ivy’ Abanyamowabu n’ivy’ Abanyegiputa n’ivy’ Abamori; ",
