              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze numvise ivyo nitantamurirakw imvune bo n’umutamana, nishikura umushatsi nishikura n’ ubganwa, nicara numiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
