        {
          "text": "Ikimazi ca ni kera kimaze gushikanwa, mva hasi aho nari nicaye ntēterewe, imvune yanje n’ umutamana wanje ar’ ibitabagurike; nca nkubita amavi hasi, nayira amaboko Uhoraho Imana yanje; ",
          "type": "text",
