        },
        {
          "text": "ivyo washingiye mu basavyi bawe wavugisha, ukavuga, ut’ Igihugu mugiyemwo ngo mucegukire n’igihugu candujwe n’ibizira vy’amahanga yo mur’ ivyo bihugu, n’ivy’ ubuyobe bakora, bacujuje ubuhumane bgabo hose iyo kiva kikagera; ",
